L107: ## Tool Provider
L108: 
L109: Handles `Query()` and `Mutation()` tool calls at runtime. The `toolProvider` prop accepts two forms:
L110: 
L111:   * Function map — `Record<string, (args) => Promise<unknown>>` — the simplest option
L112:   * MCP client — any object implementing `callTool({ name, arguments })` (e.g. from `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`)
L113: 
L114: The Renderer detects which form was passed and normalizes internally.
