L156: Step type Triggered by Description
L157: `"run"``@Run(ref)`Execute a Mutation or re-fetch a Query. `refType` indicates which.
L158: `"set"``@Set($var, val)`Change a `$variable`. `valueAST` is evaluated at click time.
L159: `"reset"``@Reset($a, $b)`Restore `$variables` to declared defaults.
L160: `"continue_conversation"``@ToAssistant("msg")`Send message to LLM. Optional `context`.
L161: `"open_url"``@OpenUrl("url")`Open URL in new tab.
